{"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Instance Property","symbolKind":"property","modules":[{"name":"IvorMXL"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"midiDevice"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL13MXLMidiDeviceV","text":"MXLMidiDevice"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}],"title":"midiDevice","externalID":"s:7IvorMXL12MXLScorePartV6Group2V10midiDeviceAA07MXLMidiG0VSgvp","role":"symbol"},"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlscorepart\/group2-swift.struct\/mididevice"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"midiDevice"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLMidiDevice","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL13MXLMidiDeviceV","text":"MXLMidiDevice"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLScorePart\/Group2-swift.struct\/midiDevice","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLScorePart","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLScorePart\/Group2-swift.struct"]]},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"text":"The MIDI device assignment for this element.","type":"text"}],"references":{"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A MusicXML parser, normalizer, validator, and formatter."}],"title":"IvorMXL","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl","type":"topic","role":"collection"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLScorePart/Group2-swift.struct/midiDevice":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLScorePart\/Group2-swift.struct\/midiDevice","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"midiDevice","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLMidiDevice","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL13MXLMidiDeviceV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?","kind":"text"}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlscorepart\/group2-swift.struct\/mididevice","abstract":[{"text":"The MIDI device assignment for this element.","type":"text"}],"title":"midiDevice"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLScorePart":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The score-part type collects part-wide information for each part in a score. Often, each MusicXML part"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"corresponds to a track in a Standard MIDI Format 1 file. In this case, the midi-device element is used to make"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a MIDI device or port assignment for the given track or specific MIDI instruments. Initial midi-instrument"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"assignments may be made here as well. The score-instrument elements are used when there are multiple"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"instruments per track."}],"title":"MXLScorePart","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLScorePart"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLScorePart"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlscorepart","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLScorePart"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLMidiDevice":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The midi-device type corresponds to the DeviceName meta event in Standard MIDI Files. The optional port"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"attribute is a number from 1 to 16 that can be used with the unofficial MIDI 1.0 port (or cable) meta event."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Unlike the DeviceName meta event, there can be multiple midi-device elements per MusicXML part. The optional"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"id attribute refers to the score-instrument assigned to this device. If missing, the device assignment affects"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"all score-instrument elements in the score-part."}],"title":"MXLMidiDevice","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLMidiDevice","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MXLMidiDevice","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlmididevice","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLMidiDevice"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLScorePart/Group2-swift.struct":{"kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Group2","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"MXLScorePart.Group2","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlscorepart\/group2-swift.struct","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Group2","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLScorePart\/Group2-swift.struct","abstract":[{"text":"A single MIDI device and instrument assignment for a score-part.","type":"text"}]}}}